# Keep local build artifacts out of the image build context. The production stage
# copies packages/ wholesale, so without this a local `make build-ui` (which leaves
# node_modules under packages/mcps/*-mcp) ships every npm dependency, dev ones
# included, into the final image. Tracked dist/ bundles (sbl-mcp) stay in.
.git
.claude/worktrees
.dagger
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
*.log
